    "note": "Committee substitute; no date in text. House passed as amended 80-29 on 2018-02-07; later amendments are not in the text read. Struck: the word 'and' before 'any location listed in subsection (13)'. Sections 3-5 only bring forward 45-9-171 (church carry), 97-37-9 and 97-3-15 unchanged. Section 2 also adds that a Veterans Health Identification Card is proof of disability for the licence-fee exemption (not quoted). Section 2 also adds that a pardon bars licence eligibility only if it says the person may not possess firearms, and that an expunged conviction is not a conviction for licence eligibility (not quoted)."
